# Google OAuth 2.0 Web-application Client ID used by the "Sign in with Google" button.
# This is a public identifier (not a secret) and is baked into the build, so it must be
# set at build time. Create the client in Google Cloud Console (see docs/auth.md §3) with
# authorized JS origins https://olives.usfkhoury.com and http://localhost:5173.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
